= Masail e Hajj --- Class 23 Summary
<masail-e-hajj-class-23-summary>
#class-meta(
  date: [June 30, 2026],
  topic: [Completing the Jurisprudence of Combining Ẓuhr & ʿAṣr at ʿArafāt (Jamʿ Taqdīm) --- the Dalīls of the Ṣāḥibayn vs.~Imam Abū Ḥanīfah, the Congregation / Imam Conditions, the Iḥrām Condition, the Khalīfah Cases --- then the Duʿā' at ʿArafāt (its Ādāb and Wording) and the Continuation of the Talbiyah],
